the lifetime of the original owner\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-standard__list-item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Damage due to burglary and fire (fire-lined safes only)\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-standard__list-item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Free freight and locksmith entries for fire or mechanical defects\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-standard__list-item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Repair or replacement with same model or equivalent at no charge\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-standard__list-item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          S&G model 6730 spin dials covered for lifetime\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"warranty-standard__card\">\n      <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-title\">Key Details<\/span>\n      <div class=\"warranty-standard__card-item\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-label\">Duration<\/span>\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-text\">Lifetime of the original owner. Non-transferable.<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"warranty-standard__card-item\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-label\">Claim Window<\/span>\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-text\">Notify us within 30 days of the incident. Proof of purchase required if not already in our system.<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"warranty-standard__card-item\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-label\">For Burglary or Fire Claims<\/span>\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-text\">Supply a letter from your homeowner's insurance company denying coverage, plus photographs of the damage.<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"warranty-standard__card-item\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-label\">Locksmith Entries<\/span>\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-text\">If within 1.5 hours of a safe technician, we assign one. Reimbursed once lock is examined by manufacturer.<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"warranty-standard__card-item\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-label\">Contents<\/span>\n        <span class=\"warranty-standard__card-text\">Contents of the safe are not included in the warranty.<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"","section_width":"page-width","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"custom_liquid_Nw7XFU":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:names.custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<style>\n  @import url('https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Anton&display=swap');\n\n  .warranty-exclusions {\n    background-color: #11151a;\n    padding: 80px 24px;\n    width: 100vw;\n    position: relative;\n    left: 50%;\n    margin-left: -50vw;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-exclusions__inner {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-exclusions__eyebrow {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;