oin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-title\">Paint Jobs<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-text\">If the safe is repaired by us, we will repaint it. If not repaired by us, we'll send enough touch-up paint to cover the damaged area yourself.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card\">\n        <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-header\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-title\">Hardplate Upgrade<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-text\">Locksmith entries are void when you purchase the hardplate upgrade. All other warranty coverage remains in full effect.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card\">\n        <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-header\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-title\">Electronic Dial<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-text\">Electronics are warranted for two years including locksmith entries. Once voided, locksmith entries are no longer covered — all other warranty terms remain.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card\">\n        <div class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-header\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-title\">Acts of God, Misuse or Abuse<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"warranty-exclusions__card-text\">Warranty is void for accidental drops, alterations to the linkage or dial, forgotten combinations, flood, earthquake, tornado, hurricane damage, or other misuse. Sturdy retains discretion to still fix at no charge if you cover shipping.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"","section_width":"page-width","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"custom_liquid_kitdLp":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:names.custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<style>\n  @import url('https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Anton&display=swap');\n\n  .warranty-buyer {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 80px 24px;\n    width: 100vw;\n    position: relative;\n    left: 50%;\n    margin-left: -50vw;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__inner {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 60px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__eyebrow {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #d4af37;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__title {\n    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #111111;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__body {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #555555;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .warranty-buyer__list-item {\n    display: flex;\n 