g your combination\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-vs__item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Cosmetic alterations to the safe\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-vs__item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Over-torquing the handle\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-vs__item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Slamming the door\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-vs__item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Not keeping it maintained by a professional\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"warranty-vs__item\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          Linkage and locks only warranted for one year\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"warranty-vs__col\">\n        <span class=\"warranty-vs__col-label warranty-vs__col-label--sturdy\">Sturdy Safe — Doe